<p>When you kill a creature, the remainder of the damage done will not be lost. Instead, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">63%, 70%, 74%, 77%, 79%</acronym> of it will splash in a radius 2 as blight damage.</p><p>The splash damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>